---
/**
 * Joule's experiment (simplified): two weights fall slowly through h, their cords turn a paddle wheel
 * in water, and the water warms. In the model all of the lost potential energy goes into the water:
 * n·M·g·h = c·m·(t − t₀). The vessel, friction and the kinetic energy of the weights are neglected.
 * The drawing is schematic (not to scale).
 */
const H_PX = 150; // travel of the weights on the drawing
const TOP = 150; // top of a weight at the start
---

<figure class="jl not-content" data-jl>
	<svg viewBox="0 0 640 372" class="jl__svg" role="img" aria-label="Опыт Джоуля: падающие грузы вращают мешалку в воде">
		<line class="jl__floor" x1="10" y1="356" x2="630" y2="356" />
		<!-- pulley stands -->
		<g class="jl__stand">
			<line x1="110" y1="120" x2="110" y2="356" />
			<line x1="530" y1="120" x2="530" y2="356" />
			<line x1="90" y1="356" x2="130" y2="356" />
			<line x1="510" y1="356" x2="550" y2="356" />
		</g>
		<!-- table under the vessel -->
		<rect class="jl__table" x="230" y="304" width="180" height="8" rx="2" />
		<line class="jl__stand-thin" x1="244" y1="312" x2="244" y2="356" />
		<line class="jl__stand-thin" x1="396" y1="312" x2="396" y2="356" />

		<!-- cords -->
		<path class="jl__cord" d="" data-cord-l />
		<path class="jl__cord" d="" data-cord-r />
		<!-- pulleys -->
		<g data-pulley-l transform="translate(110 120)">
			<circle class="jl__pulley" r="16" />
			<line class="jl__spoke" x1="-13" y1="0" x2="13" y2="0" />
			<line class="jl__spoke" x1="0" y1="-13" x2="0" y2="13" />
		</g>
		<g data-pulley-r transform="translate(530 120)">
			<circle class="jl__pulley" r="16" />
			<line class="jl__spoke" x1="-13" y1="0" x2="13" y2="0" />
			<line class="jl__spoke" x1="0" y1="-13" x2="0" y2="13" />
		</g>
		<circle class="jl__axle-dot" cx="110" cy="120" r="3" />
		<circle class="jl__axle-dot" cx="530" cy="120" r="3" />

		<!-- vessel with water -->
		<rect class="jl__water" x="258" y="186" width="124" height="114" rx="6" data-water />
		<g data-swirl></g>
		<!-- paddle wheel -->
		<line class="jl__shaft" x1="320" y1="92" x2="320" y2="292" />
		<g data-paddles></g>
		<path class="jl__vessel" d="M256,170 V294 q0,8 8,8 H376 q8,0 8,-8 V170" />
		<line class="jl__lid" x1="250" y1="170" x2="390" y2="170" />
		<!-- drum -->
		<rect class="jl__drum" x="302" y="96" width="36" height="18" rx="3" />
		<g data-drum-lines></g>
		<!-- thermometer -->
		<rect class="jl__thermo" x="367" y="58" width="10" height="226" rx="5" />
		<circle class="jl__bulb" cx="372" cy="286" r="7" />
		<rect class="jl__col" x="370" y="100" width="4" height="186" data-col />
		<g class="jl__tscale">
			{
				[20, 25, 30, 35, 40].map((v, i) => (
					<g>
						<line x1="378" y1={266 - i * 48} x2="384" y2={266 - i * 48} />
						<text x="390" y={270 - i * 48}>
							{v}
						</text>
					</g>
				))
			}
		</g>
		<g class="jl__readout">
			<rect x="400" y="40" width="100" height="34" rx="8" />
			<text x="450" y="63" text-anchor="middle" data-temp>20,00 °C</text>
		</g>

		<!-- weights -->
		<g data-w-l>
			<rect class="jl__weight" x="76" y={TOP} width="36" height="46" rx="4" />
			<text class="jl__wt" x="94" y={TOP + 28} text-anchor="middle" data-wl-t>13 кг</text>
		</g>
		<g data-w-r>
			<rect class="jl__weight" x="528" y={TOP} width="36" height="46" rx="4" />
			<text class="jl__wt" x="546" y={TOP + 28} text-anchor="middle" data-wr-t>13 кг</text>
		</g>
		<!-- height ruler -->
		<g class="jl__ruler">
			<line x1="590" y1={TOP + 46} x2="590" y2={TOP + 46 + H_PX} />
			<line x1="582" y1={TOP + 46} x2="598" y2={TOP + 46} />
			<line x1="582" y1={TOP + 46 + H_PX} x2="598" y2={TOP + 46 + H_PX} />
			<text x="597" y={TOP + 46 + H_PX / 2 - 4}>
				<tspan class="jl__math">h</tspan> =
			</text>
			<text x="597" y={TOP + 46 + H_PX / 2 + 14}>1,5 м</text>
		</g>
		<text class="jl__note" x="320" y="30" text-anchor="middle" data-note></text>
	</svg>

	<div class="jl__controls">
		<label class="jl__slider jl__slider--m">
			<span>Масса двух грузов <i>M</i></span>
			<output data-out-big></output>
			<input type="range" min="10" max="40" step="2" value="26" data-in-big />
		</label>
		<label class="jl__slider jl__slider--w">
			<span>Масса воды <i>m</i></span>
			<output data-out-w></output>
			<input type="range" min="0.2" max="2" step="0.1" value="0.5" data-in-w />
		</label>
	</div>
	<div class="jl__buttons">
		<button type="button" class="jl__btn jl__btn--primary" data-drop>Отпустить грузы</button>
		<button type="button" class="jl__btn" data-lift>Поднять грузы</button>
		<button type="button" class="jl__btn" data-auto>Повторить 10 раз</button>
		<button type="button" class="jl__btn" data-reset>Новая вода</button>
	</div>
	<div class="jl__formula" data-formula aria-live="polite"></div>
	<figcaption class="jl__caption">
		Рисунок схематический. В модели вся потенциальная энергия грузов переходит во внутреннюю энергию воды: нагревание сосуда и мешалки, трение в блоках и энергию грузов при остановке не учитываем. Высота падения 1,5 м, <i>g</i> = 9,8 Н/кг, <i>c</i> = 4200 Дж/(кг·°C).
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
